      "reason": "Resolves this morning's deferral. The dividend family (AODF, XTO, AOP, UDR, UER and others) stays quarantined (implausible caps or extreme 24h moves). Of the unflagged coins only USDF names the theme; NAFF is a bare name and AMERICA funds Trump Accounts via fees. Today's search (e2:5) returned only meme-call posts and no news about a dividend, so there is no independent source and no change from yesterday. A future run can reopen it if a news item appears."
